Use the stack that AI Studio Build supports natively. Keep UI logic in the client and all business logic and data access on the server.

- **Client:** React 18 + TypeScript + Vite, React Router, Tailwind CSS, Recharts (charts), lucide-react (icons), TanStack Query (data fetching, 5-second polling), react-hook-form + zod (forms), date-fns.
